quest title=Two Halves of a Ship
quest intro=A broken ship on a reef, on an island grown long and wide: her bow on a sandbar, her stern under the bay. The crew's camp in the dunes is the place to start.
step reach|camp|1|Find the crew's camp in the dunes
step read|First mate's diary|1|Read the first mate's diary
step open|Camp tool chest|1|Open the crew's tool chest by the cold fire
step collect|story:crowbar|1|Take the crowbar - it opens what is jammed
step reach|gannettop|1|Climb Gannet Head in the north-east to the lighthouse - the reef shows from there
step collect|story:chart|1|Take the salvage chart from the lighthouse's lamp-room box
step reach|containeryard|1|Go to the container yard on the east shore
step open|Purser's container|1|Break the chain on the purser's container with the crowbar - his diving gear is in it
step reach|stern|1|Dive to the sunk stern on the bay's floor below the reef
step open|Captain's cabin locker|1|Search the locker in the captain's torn-open cabin
step collect|story:capkey|1|Bring up the captain's key on its red cord
step reach|bow|1|Wade out to the beached bow on the sandbar
step kill|Rat|5|Clear the rats - and their king - out of the bow's sand
step open|Captain's safe|1|Force the wheelhouse door and open the captain's safe
step blueprint|Blueprint_MotorWheel|1|Take the engine plans from the captain's safe
step blueprint|Blueprint_SteeringWheel|1|Take the steering wheel plans from the captain's safe
quest done=The ship's papers are yours, and with them the drawings of an engine and a steering wheel. Her last log names a ranger station on a jungle mountain.
quest reward=Plank*10;Rope*4;Nail*12

